{
  "Uuid": "eacbd507-64e8-494a-b587-d1f2dd1385ad",
  "IsCustomNode": false,
  "Description": "Parametric bridge wizard for Civil 3D. Inputs: Repo Root Folder = the c3d-bridge-modeler repository folder; Bridge Params (JSON) = your project's parameter file (copy test/params.phase1.example.json and edit alignment/profile/surface names, stations, girders). Open the drawing with the bridge alignment data shortcuts attached, then Run. Creates the editable skeleton (support/bearing sample lines, deck plan polygon) and regenerates the solids (girders, haunches, deck slab) on BRIDGE-* layers. The Build Report output shows per-girder bearing elevations and a summary of created/preserved entities.",
